@step Import the borrador PDF you downloaded from the AEAT sede.
@static aeat app live borrador 100 import --file ./borrador-renta-2025.pdf --filing-year 2025
@blocked operator-artifact Needs the operator's own borrador PDF downloaded from the AEAT sede; a taxpayer's borrador cannot be committed as a fixture.
@step List the imported borrador snapshots that are still active.
@static aeat app live borrador 100 list --state active
@blocked operator-artifact Reads snapshots that exist only after the operator's own borrador PDF was imported.
@step View one borrador's box values.
@static aeat app live borrador 100 view <snapshot-id>
@blocked operator-artifact Reads snapshots that exist only after the operator's own borrador PDF was imported.
@step Show the latest active borrador for a filing year.
@static aeat app live borrador 100 latest --filing-year 2025
@blocked operator-artifact Reads snapshots that exist only after the operator's own borrador PDF was imported.
